        "n": "LDLDN - I Forget To Remember",
        "s": "2026-11-14T20:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-14T22:00:00Z",
        "d": "LD and guests deliver a slice of realness via jazz, fusion, deep soul, funk, warm techno and the rest. Expect music you can move to from the long-time DJ and producer.\nFrom the host: \"This month's show is a super special one. Alongside some amazing new music and a tribute to Juan Atkins, I'm going to play half of a new release on my Natural Frequency label called \"I Forget to Remember\" (an hour-long mixtape of funk, soul, and fusion edits, which is now available on Bandcamp).\"",
        "j": null,
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/spacebass/episodes/spacebass-14th-november-2026"
