      {
        "n": "HIGH NOON W/ DINA J (R)",
        "s": "2026-11-14T20:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-14T22:00:00Z",
        "d": "Dina Juntila aka Dina J is a Los Angeles based DJ. record collector and music supervisor. \"High Noon\" is a seated round about of sounds with the idea that the mix is its own OST for some unknown film. Each month features a special guest with a similar sickness.\nFrom the host: “Nothing is more painful to the human mind than, after the feelings have been worked up by a quick succession of events, the dead calmness of inaction and certainty which follows and deprives the soul both of hope and fear.”\n― Mary Shelley, Frankenstein",
